[ERR] 2026-01-22 17:41:19 | INFO | Tool Write called with {'file_path': '/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/agentCity/RSTIB_QUICKREF.md', 'content': '# RSTIB Quick Reference Card\n\n## Model Overview\n**Name**: RSTIB (Robust Spatial-Temporal Information Bottleneck)\n**Task**: Traffic Speed Prediction\n**Framework**: LibCity\n**Architecture**: MLP-based with Information Bottleneck\n\n---\n\n## File Locations\n\n```\nModel:  Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py\nConfig: Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/model/traffic_state_pred/RSTIB.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\n# Option 1: Through LibCity framework\nfrom libcity.config import ConfigParser\nconfig = ConfigParser(task=\'traffic_state_pred\', model=\'RSTIB\', dataset=\'METR_LA\')\n\n# Option 2: Direct import\nfrom libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.RSTIB import RSTIB\nmodel = RSTIB(config, data_feature)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. Model Architecture\n```\nInput [B, T_in, N, F]\n  ↓\nTime Series Embedding (Conv2d)\n  ↓\nConcatenate [time_emb + node_emb + temporal_emb]\n  ↓\nMLP Encoder (num_layer × MLP blocks)\n  ↓\nSplit → (mu, std)\n  ↓\nInformation Bottleneck (reparameterization)\n  ↓\nRegression Layer\n  ↓\nOutput [B, T_out, N, 1]\n```\n\n### 2. Key Classes\n- `RSTIB`: Main model class\n- `MultiLayerPerceptron`: MLP block with residual connections\n\n### 3. Important Methods\n- `forward(batch)`: Standard prediction\n- `forward_ib(batch, n_sample)`: Full IB mechanism with all intermediate outputs\n- `calculate_loss(batch)`: Loss with IB regularization\n- `predict(batch)`: Prediction with optional averaging\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Presets\n\n### Minimal (Fast Training)\n```json\n{\n  "num_layer": 2,\n  "embed_dim": 32,\n  "node_dim": 32,\n  "use_ib_loss": false\n}\n```\n\n### Standard (Balanced)\n```json\n{\n  "num_layer": 3,\n  "embed_dim": 64,\n  "node_dim": 64,\n  "info_beta": 0.001,\n  "use_ib_loss": true\n}\n```\n\n### Full (Maximum Performance)\n```json\n{\n  "num_layer": 5,\n  "embed_dim": 128,\n  "node_dim": 128,\n  "info_beta": 0.001,\n  "use_ib_loss": true,\n  "use_difficulty_weighting": true,\n  "if_dne": true\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Hyperparameter Guide\n\n### Architecture\n| Parameter | Range | Impact | Recommendation |\n|-----------|-------|--------|----------------|\n| `num_layer` | 2-6 | Model capacity | 3 (standard), 5 (complex) |\n| `embed_dim` | 32-128 | Representation power | 64 (standard) |\n| `node_dim` | 32-128 | Spatial features | 64 (standard) |\n\n### Information Bottleneck\n| Parameter | Range | Impact | Recommendation |\n|-----------|-------|--------|----------------|\n| `info_beta` | 0.0001-0.01 | IB strength | 0.001 (standard) |\n| `n_sample` | 1-12 | Training samples | 1 (faster), 5-12 (better) |\n| `n_sample_avg` | 1-50 | Test samples | 12 (standard) |\n\n### Features\n| Parameter | Type | Impact | Recommendation |\n|-----------|------|--------|----------------|\n| `if_spatial` | bool | Node features | true (always) |\n| `if_time_in_day` | bool | Daily patterns | true (almost always) |\n| `if_day_in_week` | bool | Weekly patterns | true (if available) |\n| `if_dne` | bool | Dynamic features | false (experimental) |\n\n---\n\n## Loss Function\n\n### Formula\n```\ntotal_loss = loss_reg / log(2) +\n             2 * info_beta * loss_info +\n             2 * info_beta * loss_info_y +\n             2 * info_beta * loss_info_x\n```\n\n### Components\n1. **loss_reg**: Prediction error (MAE-based)\n2. **loss_info**: KL divergence on encoding\n3. **loss_info_y**: KL divergence on output\n4. **loss_info_x**: KL divergence on reconstruction\n\n### Toggles\n- Set `use_ib_loss=false` to disable IB regularization\n- Set `use_difficulty_weighting=true` for harder sample focus\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### Issue 1: Loss is NaN\n**Cause**: Numerical instability in IB layers\n**Solution**:\n- Reduce `info_beta` (e.g., 0.0001)\n- Reduce `num_layer` (e.g., 2)\n- Enable gradient clipping: `clip_grad_norm=true`\n\n### Issue 2: Out of Memory\n**Cause**: Large hidden dimensions\n**Solution**:\n- Reduce `embed_dim`, `node_dim` (e.g., 32)\n- Reduce `num_layer` (e.g., 2)\n- Reduce batch size\n\n### Issue 3: Slow Convergence\n**Cause**: Too much regularization\n**Solution**:\n- Reduce `info_beta` (e.g., 0.0001)\n- Increase learning rate (e.g., 0.003)\n- Set `use_ib_loss=false` initially\n\n### Issue 4: Underfitting\n**Cause**: Model too simple\n**Solution**:\n- Increase `num_layer` (e.g., 5)\n- Increase `embed_dim`, `node_dim` (e.g., 128)\n- Enable all features: `if_spatial`, `if_time_in_day`, `if_day_in_week`\n\n---\n\n## Performance Tuning\n\n### Speed Optimization\n1. Set `n_sample=1` (single sample)\n2. Set `use_ib_loss=false` (disable IB)\n3. Reduce `num_layer` to 2\n4. Use smaller embeddings (32)\n\n### Accuracy Optimization\n1. Set `n_sample_avg=50` (many samples during test)\n2. Set `use_difficulty_weighting=true`\n3. Increase `num_layer` to 5\n4. Use larger embeddings (128)\n5. Enable DNE: `if_dne=true`\n\n### Balanced\n1. `num_layer=3`\n2. `embed_dim=64`\n3. `info_beta=0.001`\n4. `n_sample=1`, `n_sample_avg=12`\n5. `use_ib_loss=true`\n\n---\n\n## Data Requirements\n\n### Input Format\n```python\nbatch = {\n    \'X\': torch.Tensor([B, T_in, N, F]),  # F includes [speed, time_in_day, day_in_week]\n    \'y\': torch.Tensor([B, T_out, N, 1])\n}\n```\n\n### Feature Order (in X)\n- Index 0: Traffic speed (or flow)\n- Index 1: Time in day (normalized 0-1)\n- Index 2: Day in week (0-6 or normalized)\n\n### Requirements\n- `add_time_in_day=true` in config\n- `add_day_in_week=true` in config\n- Scaler: "standard" or "minmax"\n\n---\n\n## Debugging Commands\n\n### Check Model Structure\n```python\nprint(f"Parameters: {sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()):,}")\nprint(f"Hidden dim: {model.hidden_dim}")\nprint(f"IB dim: {model.K}")\n```\n\n### Test Forward Pass\n```python\nmodel.eval()\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    output = model.forward(batch)\nprint(f"Output shape: {output.shape}")\n```\n\n### Test Loss Calculation\n```python\nmodel.train()\nloss = model.calculate_loss(batch)\nprint(f"Loss: {loss.item():.4f}")\nprint(f"Finite: {torch.isfinite(loss).item()}")\nprint(f"Requires grad: {loss.requires_grad}")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Comparison with STID\n\n| Feature | STID | RSTIB |\n|---------|------|-------|\n| Architecture | MLP | MLP + IB |\n| Regularization | None | Information Bottleneck |\n| Robustness | Standard | High (noise injection) |\n| Complexity | Lower | Higher |\n| Training Speed | Faster | Slower |\n| Accuracy | Good | Better (with IB) |\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- **Paper**: Information Bottleneck-guided MLPs for Robust Spatial-temporal Forecasting\n- **Conference**: ICML 2025\n- **Original Repo**: https://github.com/mchen644/RSTIB\n- **LibCity Docs**: https://bigscity-libcity-docs.readthedocs.io/\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n- **v1.0** (2026-01-22): Initial LibCity adaptation\n  - Full IB mechanism\n  - All embedding types\n  - Configurable features\n  - Comprehensive documentation\n\n---\n\n## Contact\n\nFor issues or questions:\n1. Check `RSTIB_ADAPTATION.md` for detailed documentation\n2. Run `test_rstib_adaptation.py` for verification\n3. Review `RSTIB_SUMMARY.md` for complete overview\n'}
