n| Dataset Compatibility | `RSTIB_DATASET_COMPATIBILITY.json` | Dataset matrix |\n| Document Index | `RSTIB_INDEX.md` | Documentation index |\n\n### Example Configuration Files\n\n| File | Location | Purpose |\n|------|----------|---------|\n| METR_LA Example | `RSTIB_example_METR_LA.json` | Quick validation config |\n| PEMS_BAY Example | `RSTIB_example_PEMS_BAY.json` | Comprehensive test config |\n\n### Generated Cache Files\n\n| File | Location | Purpose |\n|------|----------|---------|\n| Model Checkpoints | `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/cache/<exp_id>/model_cache/` | Saved model weights |\n| Training Logs | `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/log/<exp_id>/` | Training logs |\n| Evaluation Results | `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/cache/<exp_id>/evaluate_cache/` | Test results |\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues and Solutions\n\n#### Issue 1: Out of Memory Error\n\n**Symptoms:**\n```\nRuntimeError: CUDA out of memory. Tried to allocate X.XX GiB\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Reduce batch size:**\n   ```json\n   {"batch_size": 32}  // or 16, 8\n   ```\n\n2. **Reduce embedding dimensions:**\n   ```json\n   {\n     "embed_dim": 32,\n     "node_dim": 32,\n     "temp_dim_tid": 32,\n     "temp_dim_diw": 32\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Disable Dynamic Node Embeddings:**\n   ```json\n   {"if_dne": false}  // Saves ~1.3M parameters\n   ```\n\n4. **Reduce inference samples:**\n   ```json\n   {"n_sample_avg": 6}  // Instead of 12\n   ```\n\n5. **Use CPU:**\n   ```bash\n   --gpu false\n   ```\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 2: Slow Training\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Training takes too long\n- Low GPU utilization\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Increase batch size:**\n   ```json\n   {"batch_size": 128}  // If memory allows\n   ```\n\n2. **Enable data loading parallelism:**\n   ```json\n   {"num_workers": 4}\n   ```\n\n3. **Reduce model size:**\n   ```json\n   {\n     "embed_dim": 32,\n     "num_layer": 1,\n     "if_dne": false\n   }\n   ```\n\n4. **Check GPU usage:**\n   ```bash\n   nvidia-smi  # Should show high GPU utilization\n   ```\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 3: Poor Convergence\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Loss not decreasing\n- High MAE after many epochs\n- Unstable training\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Reduce learning rate:**\n   ```json\n   {"learning_rate": 0.001}  // or 0.0005\n   ```\n\n2. **Enable learning rate decay:**\n   ```json\n   {\n     "lr_decay": true,\n     "lr_decay_ratio": 0.5,\n     "steps": [20, 50, 100]\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Increase patience:**\n   ```json\n   {"patience": 40}\n   ```\n\n4. **Adjust IB regularization:**\n   ```json\n   {"info_beta": 0.01}  // Higher for more regularization\n   ```\n\n5. **Train longer:**\n   ```json\n   {"max_epoch": 500}\n   ```\n\n6. **Check data normalization:**\n   - Ensure dataset uses proper scaler (z-score normalization)\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 4: Temporal Patterns Not Learned\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Model ignores time-of-day patterns\n- Poor performance during rush hours\n- Similar predictions for different times\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Verify temporal features enabled:**\n   ```json\n   {\n     "add_time_in_day": true,\n     "add_day_in_week": true,\n     "if_time_in_day": true,\n     "if_day_in_week": true\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Check temporal embeddings:**\n   ```python\n   # Verify batch contains temporal features\n   print(batch.keys())  # Should have \'time_in_day\', \'day_in_week\'\n   ```\n\n3. **Increase temporal embedding dimensions:**\n   ```json\n   {\n     "temp_dim_tid": 128,\n     "temp_dim_diw": 128\n   }\n   ```\n\n4. **Train longer:**\n   ```json\n   {"max_epoch": 500}\n   ```\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 5: Import Error\n\n**Symptoms:**\n```\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named \'libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.RSTIB\'\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Verify file exists:**\n   ```bash\n   ls Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py\n   ```\n\n2. **Check model registration:**\n   ```bash\n   grep "RSTIB" Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py\n   # Should show: from libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.RSTIB import RSTIB\n   ```\n\n3. **Reinstall LibCity:**\n   ```bash\n   cd Bigscity-LibCity\n   pip install -e .\n   ```\n\n4. **Check Python path:**\n   ```python\n   import sys\n   print(sys.path)\n   # Should include LibCity directory\n   ```\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 6: Device Mismatch Error\n\n**Symptoms:**\n```\nRuntimeError: Expected all tensors to be on the same device\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Verify bug fix #2 applied:**\n   ```bash\n   grep "eps = std.data.new" Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py\n   # Should NOT contain: Variable(cuda(...))\n   ```\n\n2. **Ensure model on correct device:**\n   ```python\n   model = model.to(config[\'device\'])\n   ```\n\n3. **Check CUDA availability:**\n   ```python\n   import torch\n   print(torch.cuda.is_available())\n   print(torch.cuda.current_device())\n   ```\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 7: NaN Loss\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Loss becomes NaN during training\n- Gradient explosion\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Reduce learning rate:**\n   ```json\n   {"learning_rate": 0.0001}\n   ```\n\n2. **Add gradient clipping:**\n   ```json\n   {"clip_grad_norm": true, "max_grad_norm": 5.0}\n   ```\n\n3. **Check for inf/nan in data:**\n   ```python\n   print(torch.isnan(batch[\'X\']).any())\n   print(torch.isinf(batch[\'X\']).any())\n   ```\n\n4. **Verify null value handling:**\n   ```json\n   {"null_val": 0.0}\n   ```\n\n---\n\n#### Issue 8: Dimension Mismatch Error\n\n**Symptoms:**\n```\nRuntimeError: expected input[B, 256, N, 1] to have 320 channels\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Verify bug fix #4 applied:**\n   ```bash\n   grep "zero_dne" Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py\n   # Should show zero-padding code\n   ```\n\n2. **Check DNE configuration:**\n   ```json\n   {\n     "if_dne": true,\n     "mid_dim": 128\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Verify temporal encoding available:**\n   ```python\n   print(\'te\' in batch.data)  # Should be True if DNE